<title>FRANCE: EU sells 14,526 tonnes German intervention rye.</title>
<headline>EU sells 14,526 tonnes German intervention rye.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-04-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>The European Union on Thursday sold 14,526 tonnes of German intervention rye to non-EU countries at a minimum price of 101.83 Ecus per tonne, a European grain official said.</p>
</text>
